Z||000000||mrfiero||08-24-2000||04:29 PM||||I just got off the phone with Tim at Fiero Parts & Appraisals.....he went to Bob's place to pick up some stuff and found out that at 2 o'clock this morning one of his buildings burned to the ground!  It was the red shed that housed his tools, a Willy's jeep and a helicopter.  They had to hose down the "big" barn full of Fiero stuff so it wouldn't catch fire!<P>It's never a good time to have a fire, but a few days before the rally has to stink!  <P>Hopefully things go well this weekend and that Bob's losses are covered by insurance. <BR> ||||reg||11
